  "description": "Wooju's obsessed with fortunes and superstitions. Dojin is a psychiatrist who happens to be gay but is still stuck in the closet. When Dojin gets set up with Wooju's older sister on a blind date, she immediately understands the situation and strikes up a deal with Dojin. She'll keep the ruse going to keep Dojin's mom happy in return for Dojin's help in treating Wooju's condition. Could Dojin be just the lucky charm that Wooju needed...? \n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
